<title>SINGAPORE: SembCorp sells two units to SML.</title>
<headline>SembCorp sells two units to SML.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sembawang Corp Ltd (SembCorp) said on Monday it had sold two of its subsidiaries to Sembawang Maritime Ltd (SML) for a total of Singapore $8.327 million.</p>
<p>SembCorp said it sold Sembawang Express Pte Ltd and Sembawang Aviation Pte Ltd at S$551,000 and S$7.776 million, respectively as part of its re-organisation following its takeover of SML.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3080)</p>
